{"op": "add", "id": "L92219bd3c2", "key": "no_duplicate_id", "at": "2026-10-20T20:44:28+08:00", "kind": "rule", "text": "因子 id 不能与现有因子重名；先看清单再起名。", "source": "kernel", "tags": ["rejected"], "note": "chg_today"}
{"op": "add", "id": "L7318c09c49", "key": "no_duplicate_expr", "at": "2026-10-20T20:44:28+08:00", "kind": "rule", "text": "不要提出与已有因子等价的表达式：直接写 chg_today / vol_ratio 这类已有因子名，或只搬运 close/volume 等原始字段，都会被判重复。要提就必须是新的组合或加工。", "source": "kernel", "tags": ["rejected"], "note": "chase_bad"}
{"op": "add", "id": "Lb3ed8f5a61", "key": "sandbox_syntax", "at": "2026-10-20T20:44:28+08:00", "kind": "rule", "text": "代码因子只能写算术、for、if、字典/列表操作；禁止 import/class/while/lambda/try/with/global，禁止任何以 _ 开头的属性，禁止 while 死循环。", "source": "kernel", "tags": ["rejected"], "note": "evil_syntax"}
{"op": "add", "id": "L0df6775215", "key": "llm:L938bade54c", "at": "2026-10-20T20:44:28+08:00", "kind": "rule", "text": "先确认因子是否与现有因子等价，再动手写代码", "source": "llm", "tags": ["distilled"], "note": ""}
